      "cat-harness:section": "Who it is for, and what they need to do",
      "prov:value": "From the page and the bean:\n- **Readers:** a maintainer or agent who wants to see what was thrown away instead of deleted, so that nobody re-enters a dead end, and so that an item can be restored."
    },
